# Salvation Swan: when it enters it exiles up to one target creature you control without flying (the Memnite). The Memnite comes back
# under its owner's control at the beginning of the next end step (CR 603.7c) as a new object (CR 400.7) with a flying counter on it
# (CR 122.1b, 702.9), so it is untapped, has no counters from before and now flies.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Pearl
Memnite
Salvation Swan
Plains x16

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Memnite.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: White)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Salvation Swan.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Target(Bot1.Battlefield.Memnite)
? Stack.Count = 1
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Exile = Memnite
? Bot1.Battlefield = Mox Pearl; Salvation Swan
? Bot1.Battlefield.Salvation Swan.Counters.Flying = (absent)
[T1 Bot1.End]
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield = Mox Pearl; Salvation Swan; Memnite
Exile.Count = 0
Bot1.Battlefield.Memnite.Counters.Flying = 1
Bot1.Battlefield.Memnite.Tapped = false
Bot1.Battlefield.Salvation Swan.Power = 3
Bot1.Battlefield.Salvation Swan.Toughness = 3
